{"id":"sackgasse","lemma":"Sackgasse","pos":"noun","rank":4211,"glosses":["dead-end street; cul-de-sac","dead end (something that does not lead one to the intended result)","impasse (stagnation that one can only overcome by fundamentally changing one’s approach)"],"ipa":"/ˈzakˌɡasə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/De-Sackgasse.ogg/De-Sackgasse.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Sackgasse","plural":"Sackgassen"},"examples":[{"text":"Das war genauso eine Sackgasse.","en":"That was a dead end as well.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"just as, just the same"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Wir sind in einer Sackgasse.","en":"We're in a blind alley.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759925","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"are","l":"sein"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Das ist eine Sackgasse.","en":"It's a dead end.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/614","words":[{"g":"the / that"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Wir befinden uns in einer Sackgasse.","en":"We're in a blind alley.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759924","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to occupy a place"},{"g":"us","l":"wir"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},null]},{"text":"Die Straße endete in einer Sackgasse.","en":"The road came to a dead end.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"street"},{"g":"to end","l":"enden"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a / one","l":"ein"},null]}]}